# Copied out of the alphaTab package by its Vite plugin on every build, so this
# is generated output rather than source. Both reappear after 'npm run build',
# byte for byte, which is why they are not worth 6 MB of repository.
src/renderer/public/soundfont/
src/renderer/public/font/

